ack\n[01:27.26]'Cause shit's about to go off ('Cause shit's about to go off)\n[Chorus]\n[01:28.80]I'm fucking that bitch, she like \"Hummina, hummina\" (Oooh)\n[01:32.64]Pull up in a Hummer with hunters, a bunch of 'em\n[01:34.22]I'm finna run it up, I'm finna run it up\n[01:35.26]I ain't Maxo, but I got that cream\n[01:36.12]Plaques, DJ Khaled, I got another one\n[01:37.22]Bitch, I'm a alien, I'm from a mother ship\n[01:38.74]I'm a barbarian, you vegetarian\n[01:40.40]You fuck nigga don't want no beef\n[01:41.92]I'm so ahead of my god damn time, nigga work twice as hard tryna get like me\n[01:45.34]Everytime I pour more, my bitch get mad, she hope I don't OD\n[01:48.82]Catch me rollin' a Backwood with your dead homies\n[01:51.02]Uh, smoke opps, then run from the police\n[Verse 2]\n[01:55.62]Every day juggin', I put in the work\n[01:57.24]I be makin' millions off of the Percs\n[01:58.84]I be makin' movies off of the Percs\n[02:00.42]In her pussy, I've been goin' to work\n[02:02.00]With the .40 I'ma go berserk\n[02:03.62]Leave a opp nigga over hurt\n[02:05.16]Two double three in the spinal cord\n[02:06.66]Degrassi him, his legs won't work\n[02:08.24]Now he can't run, take one to the brain boy, \"Bonjour\" for sure\n[02:11.62]That's what Herb' said in \"Bonjour,\" for those who can't concur (Yeah)\n[02:15.16]G Herbo my mans (Yeah), G-Money my mans (Yeah)\n[02:18.38]Bibby, that's my mans (Yeah), I'm No Limit and (Yeah, woah), I'm No Limitless (Yeah)\n[02:23.36]Took a limitless pill, that's a Perc, don't forget, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:26.56]Drugs 'til my stummy hurt, 'til I feel sick, yeah\n[02:29.54]Back to the world, tell the planet, \"Suck a dick\" (Yeah, o-oh)\n[02:32.68]Extraterrestrial, pills in my cereal\n[02:37.54]Just got off the phone with Peter, ten bands in the envelope\n[02:40.78]That's just for the drugs, ho\n[02:42.36]Rich nigga, put 15 baguettes on my big toe\n[Chorus]\n[02:45.88]I'm fucking that bitch, she like \"Hummina, hummina\"\n[02:47.52]Pull up in a Hum